<title>USA: Superior TeleCom stake held by Vinik group.</title>
<headline>Superior TeleCom stake held by Vinik group.</headline>
<dateline>WASHINGTON 1997-01-13</dateline>
<text>
<p>A group led by Boston investor Jeffery Vinik said Monday it holds a 6.3 percent stake in Superior TeleCom Inc, or 814,400 common shares.</p>
<p>In a filing with the Securities and Exchange Commission, the group said it bought the stake between November 21 and January 7 at prices ranging from $17.30 and $22.6897 per share.</p>
<p>The group said it holds the stake for investment purposes.</p>
</text>
